WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.682
Your MacBook notch

00:00:01.742 --> 00:00:02.496
turned into a

00:00:02.308 --> 00:00:03.121
dashboard

00:00:03.654 --> 00:00:04.797
ILoveNotch is a

00:00:04.609 --> 00:00:06.106
free open-source app

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:06.684
that turns the

00:00:06.496 --> 00:00:07.663
MacBook notch into

00:00:07.475 --> 00:00:08.382
a hub in

00:00:08.194 --> 00:00:09.196
ten themes

00:00:09.718 --> 00:00:10.602
It shows now

00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:11.616
playing a file

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.680
shelf calendar Reminders

00:00:13.586 --> 00:00:14.269
notes

00:00:14.317 --> 00:00:15.626
timers and per-app

00:00:15.437 --> 00:00:16.097
volume

00:00:16.275 --> 00:00:17.276
plus your Claude

00:00:17.324 --> 00:00:18.055
Codex

00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:19.706
Cursor and Copilot

00:00:19.518 --> 00:00:20.260
usage

00:00:20.399 --> 00:00:21.106
You can keep

00:00:20.918 --> 00:00:21.601
an eye on

00:00:21.413 --> 00:00:22.427
your AI coding

00:00:22.239 --> 00:00:23.488
limits without leaving

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:23.795
what you are

00:00:23.607 --> 00:00:24.196
doing

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:26.573
Version 2.0 adds a

00:00:26.385 --> 00:00:27.351
teleprompter

00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:28.363
It is native

00:00:28.175 --> 00:00:30.049
SwiftUI with near-zero

00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:31.051
idle CPU

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.604
Full story on

00:00:32.415 --> 00:00:33.311
the dashboard
